    14	 *
    15	 * - The requirement package anchors every referenced coordinate at row <= 6
    16	 *   (`A5:C6` is the lowest referenced range) and states no initial dimension, so
    17	 *   both 6 and 9 satisfy the explicit requirements.
    18	 * - Playwright's `getByRole(name)` matching is a case-insensitive substring
    19	 *   match: with 10+ rows the coordinate `A1` is also matched by `A10`, `A100`,
    20	 *   ... and any acceptance check locating a cell by its accessible name becomes
    21	 *   ambiguous. Inserting a row is an explicit requirement (sub-issue B), and a
